 skracania do 23:59.\nCzas: założenie planu.\nMapa (punkt): https://www.
 google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Princessa%20Vera%20Hotel%20Apartments
 %2017%20Tombs%20of%20the%20Kings%20Road%20Paphos\nPlan: https://cypr2026.
 pages.dev/#day-07
